# Who owns what.
#
# The restructuring split the pipeline so that no two streams share a directory and streams talk to
# each other only through the artifacts in `docs/artifacts.md`. This file records that split. Add
# your GitHub handles where the placeholders are; until then the paths themselves are the useful
# part, and a reviewer can see at a glance whether a change crosses a boundary.
#
# A change that touches two stream blocks below is a cross-stream change, and those are the ones
# worth a second pair of eyes: the layering contracts (`uv run lint-imports`) will catch an illegal
# import, but nothing catches a stage quietly changing the shape of an artifact another stream reads.

# ---- Foundation. Change-by-review after Phase 0: everything else is built on these.
/packages/geovap-core/geovap/domain/          @geovap/foundation
/packages/geovap-core/geovap/io/              @geovap/foundation
/packages/geovap-core/geovap/runtime/         @geovap/foundation
/packages/geovap-core/geovap/stages/base/     @geovap/foundation
/packages/geovap-core/geovap/stages/prepare/  @geovap/foundation
/datasets/                                    @geovap/foundation

# ---- A: panorama registration
/packages/geovap-core/geovap/stages/register/ @geovap/registration

# ---- B: semantics (optional branch; the whole distribution)
/packages/geovap-semantics/                   @geovap/semantics

# ---- C: clustering (optional branch, and the only one that imports no project code)
/packages/geovap-core/geovap/stages/objects/  @geovap/clustering

# ---- D: colour
/packages/geovap-core/geovap/stages/colour/   @geovap/colour

# ---- E: delivery -- the consolidated product, the octree, the viewer (the whole distribution)
/packages/geovap-deliver/                     @geovap/delivery

# ---- F: the app and verification
/packages/geovap-app/                         @geovap/app
/packages/geovap-core/geovap/stages/verify/   @geovap/app

# ---- Shared. A change here affects every stream.
/.importlinter                                @geovap/foundation
/pyproject.toml                               @geovap/foundation
/docs/artifacts.md                            @geovap/foundation
